WEBVTT

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.750
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.770
Episode 10

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.770
On a Moonlit Evening

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.470
<i>Morioka-san was crying, wasn't she?</i>

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.160
We should find some cover.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:33.130
<i>At a time like this, I bet Koiwai-san would have some kind words.</i>

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.700
<i>No, wait. Maybe he'd say something cheerful?</i>

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.890
<i>He's good at cheering people up.</i>

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:43.050
<i>But it's easier to imagine him teasing me.</i>

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.450
I wonder if someone's talking about me.

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:50.810
Maybe it's Sakura-chan.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.960
<i>But what am I supposed to say?</i>

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.070
<i>If I were Lily...</i>

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.660
I... I can't do it!

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.570
Cheer up, Hayashi-san!

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.830
Come on. Let's go play!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.590
Yeah!

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:23.650
Over here!

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.250
Or something.

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.600
<b>Lower            Higher            Heat</b>

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.920
U-Um, Sakurai-san?

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:34.610
Yes?

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:38.360
Th-There's something I'd like to ask you.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:40.310
Is something the matter?

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:42.130
Are the clothes too big?

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:43.360
Oh, no.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:57.130
I-I was just wondering if there was 
a place I could hang my clothes to dry.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.580
Oh, um...

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:01.380
I can put them in the dryer for you.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:04.050
S-Sorry.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:07.140
It's in the changing area by the—

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:08.220
Huh?

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.630
You're barefoot?

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.980
Oh, y-yeah...

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:13.010
I left some slippers in the hallway.

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:14.730
I'm sorry! I didn't notice!

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:20.040
Well, let's start with
 the clothes in the dryer.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.530
I-I'll take care of it!

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:31.750
<i>If he saw my underwear, 
I'd really die of embarrassment!</i>

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:36.250
Um... Is this it?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.000
<b>Start
Pause</b>

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:38.000
<i>Good afternoon.</i>

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.760
<b>Start
Pause</b>

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.760
<i>Starting drying cycle.</i>

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:45.760
Y-Yes. Please do.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:52.690
Here you go. It'll warm you up.

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:54.700
S-Sorry.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.320
It's nothing.

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:03.160
U-Um, thank you very much.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.240
Sure...

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.740
Nice and warm. Delicious, too.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:26.400
<i>The oversized hoodie is great!</i>

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.080
I-Is something the matter?

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.430
N-No, it's nothing. I just...

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.450
Just what?

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.770
Nothing! Really!

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:45.280
<i>I feel like he's totally staring at me.</i>

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.380
<i>It really is great!</i>

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:53.030
Um, Sakurai-san, how about 
you sit on the sofa, too?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.140
Sh-Should I?

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.660
I thought it'd be easier to see this way.

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:58.920
I mean...!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.290
I thought it'd be easier to talk.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.630
I guess it does feel like we're 
on a park bench or something.

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:10.660
Then how about I do this?

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:14.900
No, no. How could I ask my 
guest to sit on the floor?

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.430
I should at least sit with you.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:19.560
No, no, no. I don't think that's right!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.150
You have a wonderful place here, Sakurai-san.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.340
I wouldn't go that far.

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:30.460
My apartment is much older and smaller.

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:38.900
Curious?

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:40.900
About my computer?

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.210
I-I am.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:47.690
Sorry for staring at everything.

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:48.470
No.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:50.940
I was just noticing that the monitor isn't on,

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:54.840
but I can hear the fan, 
so I can tell the computer is.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:58.480
And how your keyboard is pink,
 which is pretty cute.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.150
But I guess it's really...

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:01.740
Really?

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.230
That computer really is

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:08.260
Lily-san's computer, right?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.570
Er, sorry!

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:14.970
Honestly, I really couldn't tell you how much
 gaming means to me! It's like my salvation!

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:17.420
And it's Lily-san and Harth-san

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:21.250
that I've really told the 
most embarrassing things to!

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:24.270
When I think about everything you've
 said to me with this computer,

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:26.550
I'm just so embarrassed and so touched!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.570
I don't even know what I'm 
going on about right now!

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.920
Sorry that I can't seem to calm down!

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:36.260
<i>Morioka-san really is flustered.</i>

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:38.520
Want to see it?

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:40.660
Can I?

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:52.010
Um, where's <i>Fruits de Mer</i>?

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:54.780
Oh, the icon is over here.

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:57.790
S-Sorry!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:58.780
No.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.310
I-I'm going to open it.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:03.540
<b>Log in</b>

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.280
So this is how Lily-san looks from her end!

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.550
This is the real deal!

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:18.840
It looks like none of the 
guild members are online.

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:23.580
<i>H-He's close.</i>

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.170
<i>I have to stay calm!</i>

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.460
<i>No good! My heart is pounding!</i>

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:33.840
S-Sakurai-san, do you ever meet 
people you know online in real life?

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:38.310
<i>I wonder if he knows Kanbe-san.</i>

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:39.580
<i>He does live close by.</i>

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:43.580
No, as you might expect.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:46.900
Since I normally conduct myself 
in a manner I think Lily would,

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:48.280
it would be difficult.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:50.010
As I'm sure you know,

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.990
I'm pretty committed to my act

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.590
and I don't really talk 
about who I really am.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.330
Is that right?

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.850
Morioka-san, you're—

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.190
I-I'm sorry!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.850
No, it's fine.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:28.250
Mo—

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:29.250
Sa—

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:38.710
I-I'm fine with this.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:40.570
I've accepted this is who I am!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.560
I'll whip something up quick.

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:55.680
<i>That was dangerous. I was close.</i>

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:56.490
Um...

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.400
Y-Yes?!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.570
I'll help.

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:18.020
<i>Sh-She's so cute.</i>

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.410
I-I-It's nothing!

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:23.150
Wow, that's hot!

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.630
Are you okay?!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.820
Delicious! So, so delicious!

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:39.420
I'm happy to hear it.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:42.450
There's extra, so eat up.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:43.240
Sure!

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.590
Thanks for the food.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:53.170
Thanks for the food.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.830
<i>I let my stomach get the
 better of me and scarfed it all down.</i>

00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:59.030
<i>Even though it was delicious,</i>

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:01.740
<i>how could someone feeling so down
just a little while ago eat all this?</i>

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:02.970
<i>I'm just...</i>

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.910
<i>She looks lost in thought again.</i>

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:10.980
I should be the one cleaning up.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:13.730
What? But you're the guest.

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:17.300
A-At least let me do the dishes.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.660
I promise not to break them.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:24.120
All right then.

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:33.300
Um, I'm really sorry about today.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:39.160
I'm sure the convenience store owner 
was surprised to see you with me.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:43.740
I think that was just her lacking tact.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.640
But, Morioka-san...

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.390
Yes?

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:52.160
You often put yourself down,

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:55.400
but I don't see you that way at all.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:12:00.470
And I'm sure that everyone else around you

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:03.690
values you much more highly 
than you think they do.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:07.910
I know you're worth more.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:10.000
And I can say

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.920
as both Lily and Sakurai Yuta...

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:29.080
I'm so happy that I met you, Morioka-san.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:30.980
So...

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:32.500
So...

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:35.310
Huh?

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.650
I-I'm sorry!

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.410
No... Let's see..

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:45.380
A h-handkerchief...

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:54.650
No...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:56.960
I'm sorry.

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:00.710
I didn't mean to cry.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.340
Not at all.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:09.350
<i>I quit my job</i>

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.960
<i>and became a NEET.</i>

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:16.180
<i>MMOs were fun,</i>

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:18.580
<i>but in some way,</i>

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.230
<i>I felt guilty about everything.</i>

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:25.950
<i>I wondered if it was really 
okay for me to be like this.</i>

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:29.670
<i>But Sakurai-san</i>

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.750
<i>just telling me he was happy we met...</i>

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:36.750
<i>makes me feel like my chest is tightening.</i>

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:38.890
<i>Like I'm both light</i>

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:40.860
<i>and heavy at the same time.</i>

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:44.510
<i>I'm filled with so many emotions
 I can't express properly.</i>

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:49.510
<i>For a while after that, I couldn't 
stop my tears from flowing.</i>

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:53.300
<i>But there was one thing I was very sure of.</i>

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.520
<i>Sakurai-san's words</i>

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.030
<i>made me feel</i>

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:02.800
<i>so very happy.</i>

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:14.040
Mo—

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:14.790
Sa—

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.420
<i>Thank you for waiting.</i>

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:18.290
<i>The drying cycle is now complete.</i>

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.700
<i>Your clothes are now warm and fluffy.</i>

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:32.550
Sorry for staying so long.

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.440
Oh, no.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:37.560
I'm sorry I couldn't give 
you a proper reception.

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:39.850
I had a lot of fun.

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:41.790
See you later.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:43.710
Oh, yeah.

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:00.980
W-Wait!

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:02.740
I'll walk you home.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:22.570
Thanks for walking me all the way home.

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:23.710
It's nothing.

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:29.020
Later.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.810
Yeah, see you later.

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.870
U-Um...

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:37.250
Yes?

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:43.880
Well, Lily and Hayashi-san are, um... well...

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:49.380
So in the same way, I want you to know, I—

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:52.200
li...

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:57.490
Huh?

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:00.440
Um...

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:06.150
No, well... Morioka-san.

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:07.200
Yes?

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.730
I'd like another day like today.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:11.910
Whether it's between Yuki-san and Harth,

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:13.940
or Hayashi-san and Lily,

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.780
or Morioka-san and Sakurai.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.510
Let's play more and talk more together.

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:23.110
In game, or anything else!

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:27.190
Yes, let's! I-I feel the same!

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:40.980
A rainbow...

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:49.520
Breath of Resurrection!

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.200
Now! Go, Hayashi!

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:07.230
This ends here!

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:11.950
Yes! We did it!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:14.860
Lily-san! Yay!

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.850
You were awesome, Hayashi-san!

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:21.100
No, it's all because I had your support!

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:24.970
I don't really get it, but it 
looks like everything worked out.

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:27.480
What's wrong? Did they have a fight?

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:31.110
Hayashi-kun seemed worried about 
something, so we were a bit concerned.

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:32.610
Yup.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:34.920
Better off just letting 
that stuff work itself out.

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.110
Right, Kanbe?

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:38.620
Yeah.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.500
Should we keep on pushing forward?

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.120
Yeah, let's do it!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.750
Jeez! I don't have a clue.

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:57.800
Hayashi-san, take a look.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.710
The full moon is beautiful.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.270
Not here. Outside! Outside!

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.050
He's right.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:24.790
Lily:  We're looking at the same moon.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:48.990
Morimori-chan!

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:51.440
K-Koiwai-san? Wh-What are you doing here?

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:55.440
I heard you and Sakura-chan 
were going on a date.

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:57.440
Da—

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:00.450
I knew it, Koiwai-san!

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:03.670
This is why I didn't want to tell you.

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.200
Now, now.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.200
I've still got work to do.

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:11.210
I won't be getting in the way of your date.

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:12.230
Da—

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:15.210
I never said it was a d-d-date!

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:18.140
You're seeing a movie then 
going out for dinner, right?

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.670
Sounds like a date to me.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:20.470
Right?

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.060
W-W-Well, that's...

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.470
K-K-Koiwai-san!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.560
Yeah, yeah.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.800
All right, I'll be getting out of your hair.

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:31.230
Oh, and Sakura-chan...

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:32.130
Yeah?

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.740
Stop! Don't go any further!

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:39.030
See you!

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:42.420
Jeez, I can't believe him.

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:45.240
Then, shall we?

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:46.730
S-Sure.

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.250
It's so cold!

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.040
Look at how close you are.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.730
What's wrong with that?

00:19:57.730 --> 00:19:59.260
What am I gonna do with you?

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:16.600
<i>Online, we're partners.</i>

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:19.140
<i>But I wonder what we look like right now.</i>

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:23.780
<i>Sakurai-san is willing to accept me as I am.</i>

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:24.780
<i>But...</i>

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:28.780
Morioka-san?

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.040
<i>I'd like to be a little more.</i>

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.770
<i>Not for myself,</i>

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:39.110
<i>but so Sakurai-san</i>

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.760
<i>will never have to feel 
embarrassed to be with me.</i>

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:46.020
<i>And so that I</i>

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:48.260
<i>won't feel embarrassed to be with him.</i>

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.110
<i>That's who I want to be.</i>

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.520
Is something the matter?

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:56.060
No, nothing.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:58.180
Then let's go. We don't want to be late.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:20:59.470
Right.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:03.610
<i>I'm going to take a step forward.</i>

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:04.900
<i>All right!</i>

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.710
Thank you very much.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:14.580
It's nothing.

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:28.930
Let's go!

